<title>USA: BFGoodrich names Price president and COO.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich names Price president and COO.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFGoodrich Co on Tuesday named David Price president and chief operating officer of the company's specialty chemicals division.</p>
<p>Price, 51, formerly of Monsanto Co, replaces Wayne Smith who resigned in November. Price was also named an executive vice president of the company.</p>
<p>BFGoodrich on June 2 named chief executive David Burner as chairman of the board to replace John Ong, who is retiring July 1.</p>
